WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.950
So the main thing is acquiring words
so that I understand more things

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.520
so that when I'm listening to it,
I find more words that I recognize.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:13.740
Hi there, Steve Kaufmann here today
and I'm going to talk about the most

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:19.810
important goal in language learning,
in other words, how to learn words.

00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:25.785
Language learning has always in my mind
being about acquiring words and I'm

00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:27.165
going to explain what I mean by that.

00:00:27.884 --> 00:00:32.415
And you'll remember that I made
this one video about the seven most

00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:34.185
important goals in language learning.

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:36.105
And number one is learning words.

00:00:36.315 --> 00:00:39.045
